## Aviso de terceiros / Third-party notice

Partes deste repositório — em especial `skills/ingest/SKILL.md`,
`skills/query/SKILL.md` e as convenções de `SCHEMA.md` (tipos de página,
frontmatter, wikilinks e o sistema de callouts) — são obra derivada de
`wiki-wonka` (https://github.com/cooperacode/wiki-wonka), traduzida para
português do Brasil e adaptada. O aviso de copyright original é preservado
abaixo, conforme exigido pela licença MIT daquele projeto.

Portions of this repository — notably `skills/ingest/SKILL.md`,
`skills/query/SKILL.md` and the `SCHEMA.md` conventions (page types,
frontmatter, wikilinks and the callout system) — are derivative works of
`wiki-wonka` (https://github.com/cooperacode/wiki-wonka), translated into
Brazilian Portuguese and adapted. The original copyright notice is preserved
below, as required by that project's MIT license.

